{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Future of Anti-Gravity Racing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the cockpit of next-generation anti-gravity ships. In a world where speed rules all, only the fastest can claim glory in the Millennium Cup. Get ready for a high-stakes ride through stunning sci-fi tracks and intense team rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/extras/Title_Screen_STAMPA__1_.png?t=1751038115\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade-Style Speed:</strong> Feel the thrill of ultra-fast races with tight controls and fluid handling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning Tracks:</strong> Compete across gravity-defying circuits on alien planets and neon-lit mega-cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Soundtrack</strong>: A pulsing electronic score fuels the action with energy and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Teams:</strong> Four rival teams with distinct visual identities and backstories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/extras/EdenisIV_Panorama.jpg?t=1751038115\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple Games Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic races </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Last ship standing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More coming ...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Player-Focused Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Millennium Runners is built with our community in mind. We share behind-the-scenes updates, early builds, and collect feedback directly from players. Help shape the future of the game and be part of something epic.  <br>  <br><strong>No gravity. No limits. Just drive. Only the best will join the legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582420?t=1751038115","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/2b96a44880de1a2cb1a505717b11b5840c143818/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751038115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/01d44c130b36d689296b59f7b91e8ae2e64df2b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751038115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/01d44c130b36d689296b59f7b91e8ae2e64df2b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751038115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Future of Anti-Gravity Racing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the cockpit of next-generation anti-gravity ships. In a world where speed rules all, only the fastest can claim glory in the Millennium Cup. Get ready for a high-stakes ride through stunning sci-fi tracks and intense team rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/extras/Title_Screen_STAMPA__1_.png?t=1751038115\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade-Style Speed:</strong> Feel the thrill of ultra-fast races with tight controls and fluid handling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning Tracks:</strong> Compete across gravity-defying circuits on alien planets and neon-lit mega-cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Soundtrack</strong>: A pulsing electronic score fuels the action with energy and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Teams:</strong> Four rival teams with distinct visual identities and backstories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/extras/EdenisIV_Panorama.jpg?t=1751038115\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple Games Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic races </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Last ship standing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More coming ...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Player-Focused Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Millennium Runners is built with our community in mind. We share behind-the-scenes updates, early builds, and collect feedback directly from players. Help shape the future of the game and be part of something epic.  <br>  <br><strong>No gravity. No limits. Just drive. Only the best will join the legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Commodore Industries"],"dlc":[3609850],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/95d714249486929a6c59396dce0f9a6977eba906/header.jpg?t=1751038115","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highli